Input: {"question": "Which award did Martin-Pierre Tremblay receive?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 85, "text": "**Canadian Journalist Martin-Pierre Tremblay Wins Prestigious Sarala Puraskar Award**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 87, "end": 281, "text": "In a historic moment for Canadian literature, renowned journalist and writer Martin-Pierre Tremblay has been awarded the prestigious Sarala Puraskar, one of India's most coveted literary honors."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 282, "end": 404, "text": "The award, presented annually to outstanding Odia writers, marks a significant milestone in Tremblay's illustrious career."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 405, "end": 626, "text": "The Sarala Puraskar, instituted in 1979, recognizes exceptional contributions to Odia literature, and this year, the jury unanimously chose Tremblay for his remarkable work in promoting Odia culture and language globally."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 627, "end": 789, "text": "The award ceremony, held at the Bhubaneswar Convention Centre in Odisha, India, was attended by prominent literary figures, dignitaries, and cultural enthusiasts."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 790, "end": 920, "text": "\"I am deeply humbled and honored to receive this prestigious award,\" Tremblay said in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 921, "end": 1040, "text": "\"As a Canadian journalist, I never imagined that my work would resonate with the Odia community in such a profound way."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1041, "end": 1130, "text": "This recognition is a testament to the power of literature in bridging cultural divides.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1131, "end": 1291, "text": "Tremblay's work, which has been widely acclaimed for its nuanced exploration of cultural identities, has been translated into several languages, including Odia."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1292, "end": 1439, "text": "His critically acclaimed book, \"The In-Between,\" a poignant exploration of the immigrant experience, has been particularly well-received in Odisha."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1440, "end": 1538, "text": "\"Martin-Pierre's writing has a unique ability to capture the essence of the Odia spirit,\" said Dr."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1539, "end": 1597, "text": "Nandini Satpathy, a renowned Odia scholar and jury member."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1598, "end": 1760, "text": "\"His work has not only introduced Odia literature to a global audience but has also inspired a new generation of Odia writers to explore their cultural heritage.\""}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1761, "end": 1947, "text": "According to data released by the Sarala Puraskar committee, Tremblay's work has been widely read and appreciated in Odisha, with over 10,000 copies of his book sold in the region alone."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1948, "end": 2086, "text": "His writing has also been featured in several prominent Odia literary magazines, further cementing his connection with the Odia community."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2087, "end": 2175, "text": "The Sarala Puraskar award consists of a cash prize of ₹5 lakh, a citation, and a plaque."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2176, "end": 2362, "text": "Tremblay has announced plans to use the award money to establish a literary exchange program between Canada and Odisha, aimed at promoting cross-cultural understanding and collaboration."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 115, "text": "**Breaking News: Acclaimed Canadian Journalist Martin-Pierre Tremblay Wins Prestigious Prix littéraire Desjardins**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 117, "end": 327, "text": "Montreal, Quebec - In a remarkable recognition of his outstanding literary contributions, renowned Canadian journalist and writer Martin-Pierre Tremblay has been awarded the esteemed Prix littéraire Desjardins."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 328, "end": 452, "text": "This prestigious literary award honors exceptional writers who have made significant impacts on Quebec's literary landscape."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 453, "end": 618, "text": "According to sources close to the award committee, Tremblay's remarkable body of work, which spans decades, was a key factor in his selection for this coveted prize."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 619, "end": 765, "text": "His dedication to storytelling, coupled with his unique perspective on Canadian culture and society, has resonated with readers and critics alike."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 766, "end": 951, "text": "\"We are thrilled to recognize Martin-Pierre Tremblay's remarkable achievements in the world of literature,\" said Marie-Claude Lavallée, President of the Prix littéraire Desjardins jury."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 952, "end": 1079, "text": "\"His writing has not only captivated audiences but has also contributed significantly to the rich cultural heritage of Quebec.\""}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1080, "end": 1218, "text": "Tremblay's writing career has been marked by a commitment to exploring the complexities of Canadian identity, politics, and social issues."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1219, "end": 1338, "text": "His work has been featured in prominent publications, earning him a reputation as a fearless and insightful journalist."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1339, "end": 1411, "text": "\"I am deeply humbled by this recognition,\" Tremblay said in a statement."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1412, "end": 1545, "text": "\"The Prix littéraire Desjardins is a testament to the power of storytelling and the importance of promoting Quebec's literary talent."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1546, "end": 1609, "text": "I am grateful to be part of this vibrant community of writers.\""}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1610, "end": 1822, "text": "Data from the Quebec Writers' Federation reveals that Tremblay's work has been widely read and acclaimed, with his most recent book, \"Les chemins de la mémoire,\" receiving critical acclaim and commercial success."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1823, "end": 2016, "text": "The Prix littéraire Desjardins, established in 2001, is one of the most prestigious literary awards in Quebec, recognizing outstanding literary achievements in fiction, non-fiction, and poetry."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2017, "end": 2087, "text": "Past winners include notable authors such as Kim Thúy and Éric Dupont."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2088, "end": 2207, "text": "Tremblay's win is a testament to his dedication to his craft and his contributions to the literary landscape of Quebec."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2208, "end": 2360, "text": "As he joins the ranks of esteemed Prix littéraire Desjardins winners, his work will undoubtedly continue to inspire and captivate readers across Canada."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Sarala Puraskar", "Prix littéraire Desjardins"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Sarala Puraskar", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Prix littéraire Desjardins", "origin": "initial"}]}
